1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,478
Hello Priya, I'm Ravi calling from the school office to ask about the science trip

2
00:00:08,478 --> 00:00:11,166
for class nine next month.

3
00:00:11,166 --> 00:00:17,679
The bus will leave from the school gate on the 14th at 7:30 AM.

4
00:00:17,679 --> 00:00:25,950
Please tell every student to bring a packed lunch, water bottle, and a notebook.

5
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:32,549
We will first go to the constellation and the show will start at ten o'clock, after

6
00:00:32,549 --> 00:00:38,671
which we will go to the botanical garden where a guide will explain to us how

7
00:00:38,671 --> 00:00:40,499
plants make their food.

8
00:00:40,499 --> 00:00:44,236
Lunch will be around one o'clock in the garden.

9
00:00:44,236 --> 00:00:50,676
The fee is three hundred and fifty rupees per student and it includes bus tickets

10
00:00:50,676 --> 00:00:51,630
and a guide.

11
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:57,159
Please collect the money and signed permission slips by Friday.

12
00:00:57,159 --> 00:01:03,829
So far, forty-two students have registered, and we have room for fifty more.

13
00:01:03,829 --> 00:01:11,114
If any student needs help with the fees, please let me know quietly, and the school

14
00:01:11,114 --> 00:01:12,957
will take care of it.

15
00:01:12,957 --> 00:01:16,380
Two parents have offered to come along.

16
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:21,082
But we still need another teacher, can you ask Mr.

17
00:01:21,082 --> 00:01:24,373
Sharma if he is available that day?

18
00:01:24,373 --> 00:01:29,169
We should be back to school by 5 PM in the evening.

19
00:01:29,169 --> 00:01:34,247
Parents can pick up their children from the main gate.

20
00:01:34,247 --> 00:01:41,300
I will send the complete plan to the class group by Wednesday, if it rains.

21
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:47,442
Instead of a picnic, there will be a visit to the science museum.

22
00:01:47,442 --> 00:01:54,151
The museum has a new section on space, so students will still enjoy it.

23
00:01:54,151 --> 00:02:01,616
Please remind students to wear their school ID cards; students who forget their

24
00:02:01,616 --> 00:02:07,286
identification will not be allowed entry to the planetarium.

25
00:02:07,286 --> 00:02:08,420
Furthermore,

26
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:15,467
No one should bring a mobile phone for emergencies, we will have teachers' phones

27
00:02:15,467 --> 00:02:16,337
available.

28
00:02:16,337 --> 00:02:22,341
For travel, the emergency contact number is the school office number.

29
00:02:22,341 --> 00:02:29,388
Another thing is that three students are allergic to food, and their parents have

30
00:02:29,388 --> 00:02:30,345
sent notes.

31
00:02:30,345 --> 00:02:34,260
I will give you those notes tomorrow morning.

32
00:02:34,260 --> 00:02:41,170
thanks for helping with this and call me back if you have any questions
